1
00:00:00,187 --> 00:00:02,977
(Howard:)Gentlemen, switching
to local nerd news...

2
00:00:03,148 --> 00:00:06,068
...Fishman, Chen, Chaudury and McNair
aren't fielding a team...

3
00:00:06,234 --> 00:00:08,114
...in the Physics Bowl this year.

4
00:00:08,278 --> 00:00:11,158
- You're kidding. Why not?
- They formed a barbershop quartet...

5
00:00:11,323 --> 00:00:14,493
(Howard:)...and got a gig playing
Knott's Berry Farm.

6
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:19,830
(Penny:)Wow. So in your world,
you're like the cool guys.

7
00:00:20,582 --> 00:00:22,752
Recognize.

8
00:00:24,086 --> 00:00:26,046
This is our year. With those guys out...

9
00:00:26,213 --> 00:00:28,923
(Leonard:)...the entire Physics Bowl
will kneel before Zod.

10
00:00:29,091 --> 00:00:31,841
- Zod?
- Kryptonian villain. Long story.

11
00:00:32,010 --> 00:00:33,340
(Raj:)Good story.

12
00:00:36,681 --> 00:00:38,931
(Sheldon:)- Count me out.
- What? Why?

13
00:00:39,101 --> 00:00:42,311
(Sheldon:)You want me to use my intelligence
in a tawdry competition?

14
00:00:42,854 --> 00:00:46,064
(Sheldon:)Would you ask Picasso
to play Pictionary?

15
00:00:46,316 --> 00:00:49,356
(Sheldon:)Would you ask Noah Webster
to play Boggle?

16
00:00:49,736 --> 00:00:52,776
(Sheldon:)Would you ask Jacques Cousteau
to play Go Fish?

17
00:00:53,990 --> 00:00:56,740
Come on, you need a four-person team.
We're four people.

18
00:00:56,910 --> 00:00:59,910
(Sheldon:)By that reasoning we should also
play bridge, hold up a huppah...

19
00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:03,040
(Sheldon:)...and enter the Olympic bobsled
competition.

20
00:01:03,208 --> 00:01:05,208
(Penny:)Tickets to that, please.

21
00:01:06,294 --> 00:01:10,134
Sheldon, what? Do I need to quote
Spock's dying words to you?

22
00:01:10,298 --> 00:01:11,378
(Sheldon:)No, don't.

23
00:01:12,259 --> 00:01:14,009
"The needs of the many..."

24
00:01:14,177 --> 00:01:16,217
"Outweigh the needs of the few..."

25
00:01:16,388 --> 00:01:18,218
"Or the one."

26
00:01:18,390 --> 00:01:21,020
Damn it, I'll do it.

